11 findings in 3 files (11 hard, 0 advisory)
bad-ref  1  Write only IDs on the Refs line, separated by commas.
code-tag-no-canonical  1  The tag names an archived requirement. Tag the current requirement.
dangling-ref  2  Fix the ID or remove the link. No entry has this ID.
missing-id  1  Add an ID to the header. Run specctx adopt --dry-run to see the plan.
req-without-scn  1  Add a scenario under the requirement.
reused-id  1  The ID is retired. Get a new ID from specctx id new.
scenario-id-mismatch  1  Give the scenario the number of its requirement.
task-without-req  1  Cite a requirement in brackets on the task line, for example [REQ-ABC-001].
task-without-verify  1  Add Verify: and a command in backticks to the task line.
unknown-cap  1  Add the code to caps under [ids] in spec-ctx.toml.
